  <description>
    <p>
      Carabiner is a desktop application designed to simplify the creation and management
      of secure network tunnels on Linux. It provides a clean, native-style interface
      for multiple tunnel providers, removing the need for complex CLI configurations.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Integrated support for Ngrok and Playit</li>
      <li>Simple setup wizards for creating new tunnels</li>
      <li>Live monitoring of tunnel status and logs</li>
      <li>Native GTK4 and Libadwaita interface for a seamless desktop experience</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
